{"title":"Besot Power Series","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Theorem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Theorem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Proof\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Proof</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Problems\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problems</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Theorem\">Theorem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Besot_Power_Series&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Theorem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Besot's Power Series Theorem states that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/d/d1dec31fdf133a883c53603edd9e9125af9967c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^m n^{a+(i-1)z} = \\frac{n^{a+mz}-n^a}{n^z-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"212\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Proof\">Proof</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Besot_Power_Series&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Proof\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let there be a sum\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/f/f2ff9ceced1439283f2f18ca2df0a34c4c502ee6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^a + n^{a+z} + ... n^{a+(m-1)z} = \\sum\\limits_{i=1}^m n^{a+(i-1)z} = s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"343\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/6/53654eb42ccb2279311e2c6ba22c515af3ee5cca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = \\sum\\limits_{i=1}^m n^{a+(i-1)z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"128\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/9/249553117dae7f47d98809cfff1992bd837b14ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$sn^z = \\sum\\limits_{i=1}^m n^{a+iz}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"119\" height=\"48\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/2/6220eb18412ead192495b4625093cd6a8319190e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$sn^z-s = \\sum\\limits_{i=1}^m n^{a+iz} - \\sum\\limits_{i=1}^m n^{a+(i-1)z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"268\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/e/71eb59f94c9f6a76132f88a7bdfbd8d836ad9b0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s(n^z-1) = n^{a+mz}-n^a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"184\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/2/0424f4aa0832a3fb8f646c2449bb5663d493c804.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = \\frac{n^{a+mz}-n^a}{n^z-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"124\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/4/82446b6f6b67446e64ce469b10928a0095c72e39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\frac{n^{a+mz}-n^a}{n^z-1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"104\" height=\"51\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problems\">Problems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Besot_Power_Series&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Problems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Besot_Power_Series&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/e/3eee4003dbe47354d9bede39c7e409e77efaf0f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3+2^5+2^7?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Besot_Power_Series&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/7/27793b14aba83b1eda1dad6e3bc0b6a721bcf860.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{2016} n^i = n^{2017}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"107\" height=\"50\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Besot_Power_Series&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018074530\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPrepro